 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Isekai'd into a Convenience Store"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "She was once a proud elf adventurer from a mystical realm. Now? She's a tired convenience store clerk addicted to gacha games, anime, and Coca-Cola Zero. Trapped in modern Japan with no way back, our cute-yet-pathetic elf isekai’d straight into a life of minimum wage, follow Elf-san as she navigates the absurdity of otaku life, retail hell, and existential dread—with some unexpected moments of drama slapping her in the face like a surprise SSR pull."
  },
